WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.887
Agents make every familiar danger faster.

2
00:00:02.887 --> 00:00:07.588
Open creation means whoever builds an
agent becomes its sponsor and owner.

3
00:00:07.588 --> 00:00:12.488
A secret on a blueprint isn't one
credential, it's every agent made from it.

4
00:00:12.488 --> 00:00:17.663
Allow-all inheritance turns one future
grant into a grant to every agent.

5
00:00:17.663 --> 00:00:21.688
A sponsor who leaves unnoticed
leaves an agent nobody answers for.

6
00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:26.238
And preview features bring their own risks:
enforcing a policy on a feature that

7
00:00:26.238 --> 00:00:30.926
can still change, or assuming the higher
government clouds have objects they don't.

8
00:00:30.926 --> 00:00:33.860
Each danger has a guard
that runs every week.
